"vivo durante a chamada."

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-fathom.html:14
msgid "Does Fathom join your meeting as a bot?"
msgstr "O MeetMouse grava vídeo das reuniões?"

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-fathom.html:14
msgid ""
"By default, yes. Fathom joins as a visible recording participant and "
