msgid "What's a private alternative to Fathom?"
msgstr "O MeetMouse funciona em chamadas sem Wi-Fi?"

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-fathom.html:16
msgid ""
"For bot-free notes, Granola. For a fully private tool where no audio or "
"transcript ever leaves your machine, MeetMouse — it writes your notes on-"
"device and coaches you live."
msgstr ""
"Sim. A transcrição e o modelo de IA rodam localmente no hardware do seu "
"Mac, operando perfeitamente mesmo offline."

