#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-fathom.html:25
msgid ""
"<strong>Fathom</strong> by default sends a bot into your Zoom, Meet, or "
"Teams call, records everything, and hands you polished summaries and "
"action items afterward. Free, unlimited. It's the tool I recommend first "
"when someone says \"I just want notes and I don't want to pay.\""
msgstr ""
"<strong>Fathom</strong> por padrão envia um bot para sua chamada Zoom, "
"Meet ou Teams, grava tudo e te entrega resumos polidos e itens de ação "
"depois. Gratuito, ilimitado. É a ferramenta que eu recomendo primeiro "
"quando alguém diz \"Eu só quero anotações e não quero pagar.\""

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-fathom.html:26
msgid ""
"<strong>MeetMouse</strong> works the other side of the meeting. No bot, "
"no cloud archive — it runs on your Mac, writes the transcript, summary "
"and next steps there, and shows you short coaching cues in an overlay "
