#: site/content/best.py:1
msgid "Best AI meeting tool for founders"
msgstr "Melhor ferramenta de reunião com IA para fundadores"

#: site/content/best.py:1
msgid ""
"Pitches, customer discovery, hiring — the calls where one sentence "
"matters more than the summary."
msgstr ""
"Pitches, customer discovery, contratações — reuniões onde uma frase "
"importa mais do que o resumo."

#: site/content/best.py:1
msgid ""
"Founder calls are high stakes, few people, sensitive (your runway, their "
