#: site/content/best.py:1
msgid "free notes in anybody's Zoom"
msgstr "notas gratuitas em qualquer Zoom"

#: site/content/best.py:1
msgid ""
"Joins any meeting the host lets it into and writes excellent summaries. "
"Everybody sees it."
